# Core Standards
All development must adhere strictly to the rules documented in `AGENTS.md`.
- Run `pnpm check` to verify linting, TypeScript types, and unit tests before completing any task.
- Follow the unidirectional dependency architecture: `app` -> `features` -> `components`, `lib`, `api`.
- Never install unapproved dependencies or icon packages.
